# Smart Dimension on a point and a line: P, then L1, the label placed and
# Enter keeps the measured value: line_dist(P, L1, 1), P on the left of L1
# (d1). Then L1, then P, which d1 measures already: a reference dimension,
# and no editor opens (d2).
open tests/data/sketch-dimension.json
wait 16
action tool.dimension
wait 2
click L 396 175
click L 360 248
click L 542 211
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 360 248
click L 396 175
click L 542 211
wait 2
